==Strategy==
Nearly any [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare]] or [[:Category:Legend Rare Cats|Legend Rare]] with [[Resistant|Resistance]] against Floating or Alien can pretty much solo this stage, so use them if you have them, just do not summon shorter ranged cats, as they may cause the Dolphinas to hit such unit.

In spite of this, [[Ancient Egg: N108 (Super Rare Cat)|Soap Cat]] completely trivializes this stage; its high speed, short range, and Resistance to Aliens make it so that the Dolphinas will almost never score hits on the slippery fellow, and Calamary's attacks are reduced to nothing more than a mere tickle. Pair this unit with any [[:Category:Rusher-class Cats|Rushers]] at your disposal, and this stage is as good as won.

